{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><figure><img src=\"https://cdn3.am730.com.hk/processed/2026-11/1065323/block/singleImage/3275930/df/01M84EW4D0GW5GSNQ9Y71PTN9R.jpg?updatedAt=1795446190\"/><figcaption>海關檢獲共約12萬件懷疑冒牌貨物。</figcaption></figure><p>香港海關一連三星期採取執法行動，重點打擊「雙十一」購物節期間跨境轉運及供應本地冒牌貨物活動。行動中，海關偵破39宗相關案件，檢獲共約12萬件懷疑冒牌貨物，包括手表、鞋履、服飾、電子產品，估計市值共約6,800萬元並拘捕兩名人士。海關指，相信部分貨物會轉運至美洲及中東等海外地區，並正準備在當地市場分銷及轉運出售。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-23T21:41:30.103178+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":174,"images":1,"source":"am730","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-23T20:00:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-24T01:27:50.821696+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-23T21:34:49.719228+00:00","content_hash":"ace00e414f1875adf57c7f655e5cce2c7eec9d1d88e7c9e6819572425b311090","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-23T21:41:30.103178+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}